{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2022-06-27 18:34:00', 'title': 'HP ANNOUNCES COMMENCEMENT OF EXCHANGE OFFER AND CONSENT SOLICITATION FOR PLANTRONICS NOTES', 'text': 'PALO ALTO, CALIF., JUNE 27, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HP INC. (NYSE: HPQ) (“HP” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT COMMENCED A PRIVATE EXCHANGE OFFER TO CERTAIN ELIGIBLE HOLDERS (THE “EXCHANGE OFFER”) FOR ANY AND ALL OUTSTANDING NOTES (THE “POLY NOTES”) ISSUED BY PLANTRONICS, INC. (NYSE: POLY) (“POLY”) FOR UP TO $500,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF NEW NOTES TO BE ISSUED BY THE COMPANY (THE “HP NOTES”) AND CASH.'}